 relating to the current or an earlier period are held from staging/processing until the period is closed or reopened. This INPUT event is not a revenue line, COGS recognition, or manual cost adjustment exception.\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"policy_evidence\\\": {\\n    \\\"resource_id\\\": \\\"r_3b47185690520ace21c00de8\\\",\\n    \\\"source_file\\\": \\\"workspace/02_Cost_Accounting/oracle_supply_chain_cost_management_26b.pdf\\\",\\n    \\\"section\\\": \\\"Cost Accounting Period Statuses and Transaction Accounting\\\",\\n    \\\"pdf_page\\\": 233,\\n    \\\"printed_page\\\": 225,\\n    \\\"quoted_rule\\\": \\\"Transactions created after the pending close date, even if they relate to a current or prior period, won't be processed.\\\",\\n    \\\"quoted_release_condition\\\": \\\"After the period is closed or reopened, these new transactions will be processed.\\\",\\n    \\\"quoted_exceptions\\\": \\\"Revenue lines, COGS recognition, and manual cost adjustments will continue to be processed even after the period is set to Pending Close.\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"source_provenance\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"resource_id\\\": \\\"r_3b47185690520ace21c00de8\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Task records\\\",\\n      \\\"content_sha256\\\": \\\"77129c2275b1708302c90753b4f186a1e6de5e3649f76593bbda72f103869027\\\",\\n      \\\"business_source_file\\\": \\\"system/oracle_scm_cost_management/state.db\\\",\\n      \\\"record_keys\\\": [\\n        {\\\"table\\\": \\\"work_orders\\\", \\\"work_order_number\\\": \\\"MO-25-09-1070\\\", \\\"work_order_id\\\": \\\"WO-2025-09-004\\\"},\\n        {\\\"table\\\": \\\"cost_periods\\\", \\\"cost_period_id\\\": \\\"PER-COST-2025-09\\\"}\\n      ],\\n      \\\"also_contains\\\": \\\"Oracle 26B policy excerpt, PDF page 233 / printed page 225\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"resource_id\\\": \\\"r_c5101a84b7863959f8da52a0\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Supporting records\\\",\\n      \\\"content_sha256\\\": \\\"48f4954e1a6f64b25b2a017104252db6df7706332845eb67